{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06931","headline":"古意三首 一 · 常建","name":"古意三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二妃方访舜，万里南方悬。\n远道隔江汉，孤舟无岁年。\n不知苍梧处，气尽呼青天。\n愁泪变楚竹，蛾眉丧湘川。\n後人立爲庙，累世称其贤。\n过客设祠祭，孤狸来坐边。\n怀古未忍还，猿吟彻空山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}